#: includes/campaigns_list_help.php:45
msgid "Quick Actions in every Row."
msgstr "Rýchle akcie v každom riadku."

#: includes/campaigns_list_help.php:49
msgid "Opens the campaign, the same as clicking its name."
msgstr "Otvorí kampaň, rovnako ako kliknutie na jej názov."

#: includes/campaigns_list_help.php:51
msgid "Change the main fields without opening the campaign editor."
msgstr "Zmení hlavné polia bez otvárania editora kampane."

#: includes/campaigns_list_help.php:53
msgid "Send the campaign to the trash."
msgstr "Presunie kampaň do koša."

#: includes/campaigns_list_help.php:55
msgid ""
"Creates a new campaign with every field of this one. Its title gets \"(copy)"
"\" added."
msgstr ""
"Vytvorí novú kampaň so všetkými poľami tejto. K jej názvu sa pridá „(copy)“."

#: includes/campaigns_list_help.php:57
msgid "Clears the log, the last run data and the post count of the campaign."
msgstr "Vymaže záznam, údaje posledného spustenia a počet článkov kampane."

#: includes/campaigns_list_help.php:59
msgid ""
"Every campaign saves a hash of the last feed item it fetched, to avoid "
"duplicates. This deletes it, so those items can be fetched again."
msgstr ""
"Každá kampaň si ukladá hash poslednej získanej položky, aby sa vyhla "
"duplicitám. Toto ho vymaže, takže tie položky možno získať znova."

#: includes/campaigns_list_help.php:61
msgid "Opens the log of the last run in a new window. No older logs are kept."
msgstr ""
"Otvorí záznam posledného spustenia v novom okne. Staršie záznamy sa "
"neuchovávajú."

#: includes/campaigns_list_help.php:63
msgid "Export"
msgstr "Exportovať"

#: includes/campaigns_list_help.php:63
msgid ""
"Professional feature. Exports this campaign to a file you can import into "
"another WordPress site."
msgstr ""
"Funkcia Professional. Vyexportuje túto kampaň do súboru, ktorý môžeš "
"importovať na inej stránke WordPress."

#: includes/campaigns_list_help.php:73
msgid "Run Multiple Campaigns at once."
msgstr "Spustenie viacerých kampaní naraz."

#: includes/campaigns_list_help.php:77
msgid "Tick the checkbox in the first column of each campaign you want to run."
msgstr ""
"Zaškrtni políčko v prvom stĺpci pri každej kampani, ktorú chceš spustiť."

#: includes/campaigns_list_help.php:79
msgid "The orange button starts the run, which can take a long time."
msgstr "Oranžové tlačidlo spustí beh, ktorý môže trvať dlho."

#: includes/campaigns_list_help.php:81
msgid ""
"Each campaign reports at the top of the page, and the Posts column turns red "
"when the run published something."
msgstr ""
"Každá kampaň sa hlási navrchu stránky a stĺpec Články sčervenie, keď beh "
"niečo publikoval."

#: includes/campaigns_list_help.php:95
msgid "Bulk Edit changes the main fields of every campaign you select at once."
msgstr "Hromadná úprava zmení hlavné polia všetkých vybraných kampaní naraz."

